{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40635","headline":"送皇甫校书自蜀下峡归觐襄阳 · 李洞","name":"送皇甫校书自蜀下峡归觐襄阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蜀道波不竭，巢乌出浪痕。\n松阴盖巫峡，雨色彻荆门。\n宿寺青山尽，归林彩服翻。\n苦吟怀冻馁，爲吊浩然魂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40635.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40635","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}